                <note rend="inline" type="source">839.918/1: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Russell</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-12-23T13:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 23,
                                1919—1 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Information has reached the Department that regulations as to censorship have
                    been modified. Inform Department extent of changes and when made.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
